WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.200
Clothes must work in three places.

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.400
The life you really live,

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:09.800
your closet beside everything else you own,
and your own home.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.000
A store can show you only one of the three,
and it's the store.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.900
So every question comes down to this.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.200
Will it still work in your own front hall?
